  (text "POWER: nRF52840 in NORMAL voltage mode = VDD + VDDH tied @ PS p81 on the ONE 3.0V rail\nfrom U7 (SNS sheet). REG0 is OFF in this mode @ PS p82\ncircuit = Nordic config 5 @ PS p948 fig 222, values @ PS p949 table 79\nNOT as config 5: C6 = 1u where Nordic has 4.7u, the rail already carries 23.5u (SNS sheet)\nRF match = config 7's (RF note). X5R where Nordic lists X7R / X7S: C6, C14, C15, C20, C21\nC9 820p on DEC5: NEEDED on build codes Dxx and earlier = this QIAA-R @ PS p928 + p976 + p68\nNEVER enable a DCDC without its LC filter @ PS p82: REG1 has L2 + L3, REG0 has none\n-> DCDCEN = 1, DCDCEN0 stays 0, NO REGOUT0 write (README Rails)"
    (at 292.1 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6aca43b3-1cb4-4290-a721-b5e3dd1ab37c")
  )
  (text "CLOCKS: X1 32MHz = NDK crystal for radio + USB, CL 10p @ NDK spec p1\nC1 = C2 = 16p = that 10p with pin + pcb stray @ PS p159. NOT Nordic's 12p for an 8p crystal @ PS p949\ncrystal + caps = 24.4ppm in year 1 (calc) = inside the 30ppm BLE limit @ PS p171\nY1 32.768kHz TCXO = the ONE low freq clock for MCU + IMU so they can't drift apart\n+-1.9ppm = its 0-50C row ONLY @ TCXO DS p5 -> firmware MUST correct each device's rate\nOUT -> R1 100R -> XL1, XL2 open @ PS p161. OUT -> R2 5.1k -> IMU CLKIN. load <= 30pF @ TCXO DS p5\nR1 = edge damping, no datasheet value. R2 5.1k as IMU pin 9 resets as an open drain output\n@ ICM DS p106: 0.60mA max (calc)\nsupply = VDD -> R24 1k + C47 4.7u = the 1 to 10ms/V ramp its reset needs @ TCXO DS p7\nC23 100n = the >= 0.1u bypass @ TCXO DS p3. OE on its supply, must not float @ TCXO DS p1"
    (at 292.1 55.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a65f9053-1992-4502-9983-ab3aaae971b1")
  )
  (text "RF: C3 1p - L1 4.7nH - C4 1.2p - L5 2.2nH = Nordic config 7 match @ PS p952 fig 224 + p953 table 83\nused on config 5's supply (POWER note): Nordic shows no such pair\nC3 ground -> VSS_PA ball, not the plane @ PS p968\nC3 / C4 = +-0.1p parts, Nordic asks NP0 5% @ PS p953\nL6 6.8nH = Walsin's match on their 1.2mm board @ antenna DS p3 + p4 -> RETUNE on this 0.8mm board\nC44 / C45 = EMPTY shunt pads each side of L6 for that, NOT fitted, not in the BOM or position file\nantenna: pad 2 isolated, 6x6mm clearance @ antenna DS p3. 50R feed, keepout under the match @ PS p967"
    (at 292.1 100.33 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "1ef2a104-9356-4592-a6d8-04ce8bc46508")
  )
  (text "CLOCK START: Y1 runs whenever the board has power, firmware can NOT switch it\nvalid within 1s at 25C, 3s over -40..105C @ TCXO DS p5, the MCU runs long before\n-> firmware MUST boot on LFRC, then stop LFCLK, select the TCXO, restart (README F4)\nLFCLKSRC must NOT be written while LFCLK runs @ PS p160\nY1 wants VCC at GND for > 10s before power returns @ TCXO DS p7: a faster cell swap = NOT stated"
    (at 292.1 139.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "0a473b52-dae3-458b-8681-7d136c0c0b60")
  )
  (text "BUSES: the speeds are MAX values for firmware (README F6)\ncard SPI = SPIM3 at 16MHz: default speed ends at 25MHz @ SD spec p253, SPIM steps 8 / 16 / 32 @ PS p734\nIMU SPI = SPIM2 at 4MHz: MCU data valid up to 59ns after the edge @ PS p739, IMU needs 13ns @ ICM DS p24\nI2C A (charger + gauge) = TWIM0, R6/R7 10k to VDD. I2C B (mag) = TWIM1, R9/R19 10k to VDD\n10k = named by BQ25180 DS p4 + MMC5983MA DS p12\nBOTH at 100kHz, NOT 400: gauge pins up to 60pF @ MAX17048 DS p3 = too slow on 10k @ I2C spec p44\nmag pin capacitance = NOT stated @ MMC5983MA DS p3\npullups must stay >= 2.65k (calc): MCU pin sinks 1mA min at 0.4V @ PS p370\nIMU on SPIM2 as TWIM1 shares its ID with SPIM1 @ PS p24. LED on I2S SDOUT, SCK/LRCK on P0.24 + P1.08"
    (at 292.1 163.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "4901b3a1-bdb3-4958-b0da-23a46d588a91")
  )
  (text "MCU PINS (HIGH = 3.0V VDD, LOW = GND)\nP0.00 XL1 (D2)        In      32.768kHz clock in from TCXO     via R1 100R, XL2 open. boot on LFRC first (README F4)\nP0.04 BTN (J1)        In      start / stop button              HIGH = pressed. NO resistor: internal PULLDOWN + SENSE high = wake (README F6)\nP0.05 MAG_INT (K2)    In      magnetometer measurement done    HIGH = data ready, hi-Z until enabled so internal pulldown. GPIOTE timestamp\nP0.06 IMU_MISO (L1)   In      IMU SPI data in                  SPIM2 MISO\nP0.07 IMU_INT (M2)    In      IMU data ready / FIFO watermark  resets open drain active LOW, set push pull first (README IMU). GPIOTE timestamp\nP0.08 IMU_CS (N1)     Out     IMU SPI chip select              software CS, LOW = selected. HIGH before the first IMU access (README F3)\nP0.11 BMS_SCL (T2)    Out     I2C bus A clock, charger+gauge   TWIM0 SCL 100kHz, R6 10k to VDD\nP0.12 BMS_SDA (U1)    In/Out  I2C bus A data                   TWIM0 SDA, R7 10k to VDD\nP0.13 LED_DIN (AD8)   Out     RGB LED data                     I2S SDOUT, idle LOW, R22 10k pulldown\nP0.14 SD_EN (AC9)     Out     microSD power enable             HIGH = 3V0_SD on. LOW by default: R20 1M pulldown\nP0.15 CHG_INT (AD10)  In      charger interrupt                LOW pulse = event. NO resistor: internal PULLUP (README F6)\nP0.16 SD_DET (AC11)   In      microSD card present             LOW = no card. NO resistor: internal pullup ONLY while sampling (README F5)\nP0.17 SD_CS (AD12)    Out     microSD SPI chip select          SPIM3 CSN, LOW = selected\nP0.18 NRESET (AC13)   In      reset from SWD pad 3             LOW = reset, only after UICR PSELRESET = 18\nP0.19 SD_SCK (AC15)   Out     microSD SPI clock                SPIM3 SCK 16MHz MAX, R21 10k pulldown\nP0.20 MAG_SCL (AD16)  Out     I2C bus B clock, mag only        TWIM1 SCL 100kHz, R9 10k to VDD\nP0.21 SD_MOSI (AC17)  Out     microSD SPI data out             SPIM3 MOSI -> card CMD\nP0.22 MAG_SDA (AD18)  In/Out  I2C bus B data                   TWIM1 SDA, R19 10k to VDD\nP0.23 SD_MISO (AC19)  In      microSD SPI data in              SPIM3 MISO <- card DAT0, R15 10k to 3V0_SD\nP0.24 (AD20)          Out     I2S SCK, no connection           needed by the I2S block for the LED, pad open\nP0.25 FG_ALRT (AC21)  In      fuel gauge alert                 LOW = alert until cleared. NO resistor: internal PULLUP (README F6)\nP0.26 IMU_SCK (G1)    Out     IMU SPI clock                    SPIM2 SCK 4MHz MAX\nP0.27 IMU_MOSI (H2)   Out     IMU SPI data out                 SPIM2 MOSI -> IMU SDI\nP1.00 SWO (AD22)      Out     debug trace out                  to SWD pad 6, optional\nP1.08 (P2)            Out     I2S LRCK, no connection          needed by the I2S block for the LED, pad open\nP1.09 (R1)            -       spare, no connection\nSWDIO AC24, SWDCLK AA24      debug                            SWD pads 2 + 4, nothing fitted\nD+ AD6, D- AD4        In/Out  USB data                         full speed, no series parts\nVBUS (AD2)            In      USB 5V in                        via R5 2.2R\nANT (H23)             -       2.4GHz antenna                   50R, config 7 match\nXC1/XC2 (B24/A23)     -       32MHz crystal                    must run for radio + USB\nVDDH (Y2)             -       tied to VDD = the 3.0V rail      normal voltage mode. cell voltage = fuel gauge ONLY, NOT the SAADC\nVDD (B1 A22 W1 AD14 AD23)     3.0V IN from U7 (SNS sheet)      DCDCEN = 1, DCDCEN0 stays 0\nDCCH (AB2), DCC (B3)  -       DCDC inductor pins               DCCH open. DCC -> L2 + L3 -> DEC4/6\nDEC1/DEC3/DEC4=DEC6/DECUSB    internal reg decoupling          C5 / C11 / C15 + C16 / C20. DEC2 open\nDEC5 (N24)            -       1.3V reg decoupling              C9 820p, needed on this QIAA-R @ PS p928\nVSS B7, VSS_PA F23, pad       ground                           C3 returns to VSS_PA\nP0.02/03/09/10/28-31 P1.01-07/10-15  spare, low freq only     not connected @ PS table 61"
    (at 17.78 212.09 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e2523006-2dff-4e3f-9b9d-8553be9c3e2b")
  )
  (text "USB: D+/D- straight to the MCU, external pullup forbidden @ PS p853, full speed 12Mbps @ PS p850\nR5 2.2R in the VBUS feed = Nordic's optional series R, \"recommended for new designs\" @ PS p938\nsource + cable + R5 must stay <= 6R @ PS p157\nC21 4.7u on VBUS, C20 4.7u on DECUSB (>= 2.35u @ PS p157)"
    (at 292.1 125.73 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d33b9781-5eda-4f30-80c7-947f341cf8f4")
  )
